+Filter entries in place with `removeWhere`; it returns the number of removed entries and passes each entry with its original zero-based index to the predicate:
+
+```js
+const denque = new Denque([1, 2, 3, 4]);
+denque.removeWhere((value) => value % 2 === 0); // 2
+denque.toArray(); // [1, 3]
+```
+
 
 See the [API reference documentation](https://docs.page/invertase/denque/api) for more examples.
 
